The reActionPinningRefs for MajorMinor: atLevel=reActionPinningMajorMinor, stricter=reActionPinningSemver. A commit SHA doesn't match semver regex! For major-minor level, stricter should also include commit-sha. Fix: for MajorMinor, stricter check should be "matches semver OR commitSHA". Simplest: isPinned — check each level <= target from strictest to weakest:

```
func (rule *RuleActionPinning) isPinned(ref string) bool {
    if rule.level <= ActionPinningLevelCommitSHA && reActionPinningCommitSHA.MatchString(ref) { return true }
    if rule.level <= ActionPinningLevelSemver && reActionPinningSemver.MatchString(ref) { return true }
    if rule.level <= ActionPinningLevelMajorMinor && reActionPinningMajorMinor.MatchString(ref) { return true }
    return false
}

